    {
      "text": "You can edit or delete a business unit when required."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Editing a Business Unit",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Administration > Business Unit Management.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          20
        ],
        [
          23,
          47
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Business Unit Management page, click the Edit icon for the business unit that you want to edit.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          31
        ],
        [
          48,
          52
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Edit Business Unit window, change the Name or select a different Group from the drop-down menu.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          25
        ],
        [
          45,
          49
        ],
        [
          72,
          77
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Deleting a Business Unit",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To delete a business unit:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Administration > Business Unit Management.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          20
        ],
        [
          23,
          47
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Business Unit Management page, click the Delete icon for the business unit that you want to delete.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          31
        ],
        [
          48,
          54
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Delete Business Unit window, click Delete.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          27
        ],
        [
          42,
          48
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "text": "If any cloud account is associated with the business unit, then you must move the cloud account to another business unit. Otherwise, ZPC moves the cloud account to a default business unit. See image."
    }
  ]
}
